{"id":76485985167649,"name":"[DUELS] Advanced Ragdoll Fighting","desc":"IF YOU HAVE NOT RECIEVED SOME OF GAMEPASSES THEN YOU NEED TO EQUIP IT IN SHOP\n\n\n\nA free-roam ragdoll game with melee system, where you can have fun with ragdoll system and fight with other players at the same time. Generally a remake of BRE (Bloody Ragdoll Engine).\n\n\n\nControls:\n\nPC / Keyboard: Shift - Run / Ctrl - Camera Lock / R - Ragdoll / H - Dances\n\nConsole / Gamepad: ButtonX - Ragdoll / ButtonY - Run / D-Pad Left - Emotes menu / D-Pad Up - Camera Lock\n\n\n\nOwner: dementiadev (known as foxbigsosig)\n\nCo-Owner / Manager: ArteryAlex\n\n\n\n\n\nTags: Bloody Ragdoll Engine , Ragdoll , Ragdoll Physics , BRE , UnBloody Ragdoll Engine , Ragdoll Engine , Melee , Weapons , Pvp","path":"/game/76485985167649-advanced-ragdoll-fighting","slug":"76485985167649-advanced-ragdoll-fighting","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/13145ba1346fe464f0802af9ddc37de02b472d06a4fb308d57847d74aaa7215f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7eaf57b34b8eea649862c9275bd8a627/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":12,"visitor":7897400,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-18T16:40:14.972Z","creator":{"name":"Sosig Studios.","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6a5bac6e9007166696a6d592","title":"Controllable Ragdoll","game":{"_id":"687bff39296885fe891e637c","gameId":76485985167649,"name":"[DUELS] Advanced Ragdoll Fighting","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ffa79e7b1ef5e33002f285739a79707e2e74efa02f26d0d3dd027a628f6aca67.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-c555b81ba9a476e5d0671dc72a5c72d1-11451b670efb.png"},"slug":"76485985167649-advanced-ragdoll-fighting","path":"/game/76485985167649-advanced-ragdoll-fighting","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ffa79e7b1ef5e33002f285739a79707e2e74efa02f26d0d3dd027a628f6aca67.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-c55